For training the data, a two-level stacking ensemble was used. The base classifiers considered the entire input set for every individual classifier, which allows the classifiers with different hypotheses and algorithms to work independently; the meta-classifier used the cross-validated predictions of the base classifiers for training. After pre-processing, the data was fed into the proposed model. The algorithm of the proposed stacking model is given in Algorithm 1.\n"
